   "description": "The printed population-2 sample list orders samples 4–9 as (5,4),(5,5),(5,5),(5,4),(5,5),(5,5); the table here lists the 9 with-replacement pairs in systematic order (4,4),(4,5),(4,5),(5,4),(5,5),(5,5),(5,4),(5,5),(5,5), giving the same p̂₂ values row by row as printed."
